WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.503
- All right! We always leave a little time

00:00:01.503 --> 00:00:04.010
at the end of the show
to spread some more joy.

00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:05.147
This is What I'm Liking.

00:00:05.147 --> 00:00:07.397
(cheering)

00:00:08.331 --> 00:00:09.580
- So not long ago,

00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:11.630
a Virginia math teacher, named PJ,

00:00:11.630 --> 00:00:14.469
was out at target with
some friends, as you do.

00:00:14.469 --> 00:00:16.830
They were taking some videos of them

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:18.670
just dancing around and having fun

00:00:18.670 --> 00:00:20.480
and then they tried something new.

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:23.790
They decided to spontaneously
pose with random strangers,

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:26.513
which is great. It's
fantastic. Check this out.

00:00:27.454 --> 00:00:30.371
(electronic music)

00:00:53.201 --> 00:00:56.132
(cheering)

00:00:56.132 --> 00:00:58.020
People be ready for the moment y'all.

00:00:58.020 --> 00:01:00.000
They were like, oh wait, I got this.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.230
That's like, everybody's ready
for their moment on camera.

00:01:02.230 --> 00:01:03.070
It's amazing.

00:01:03.070 --> 00:01:06.460
The moment PJ posted the
videos to TikTok, they blew up.

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:07.770
Cause they're awesome.

00:01:07.770 --> 00:01:09.390
We have PJ on the line right now,

00:01:09.390 --> 00:01:12.414
along with his friends, Kitrel
and Amir. What's up y'all?

00:01:12.414 --> 00:01:13.814
(cheering)

00:01:13.814 --> 00:01:15.360
- Hello.
- How you doing?

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:17.523
- Oh my gosh. Y'all are so funny,

00:01:17.523 --> 00:01:20.330
but PJ, tell us more about
how this all happened.

00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:23.050
Who just decided to be like,
hey, let's just do this?

00:01:23.050 --> 00:01:26.386
- So one evening, like
Thanksgiving weekend,

00:01:26.386 --> 00:01:28.156
me and Amir right here,

00:01:28.156 --> 00:01:30.780
we went to target and made
our daily content, you know,

00:01:30.780 --> 00:01:33.440
dance videos, everything was good.

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:37.197
And all of a sudden Kitrel
and Lamont walked up

00:01:37.197 --> 00:01:40.740
and they joined us like,
you know, made dance videos.

00:01:40.740 --> 00:01:43.050
And then Kitrel came up
with a brilliant idea

00:01:43.050 --> 00:01:45.180
and he was just like, let's walk around

00:01:45.180 --> 00:01:46.920
and get people's reactions. You know?

00:01:46.920 --> 00:01:49.450
Let's just take random
pics with people in public.

00:01:49.450 --> 00:01:52.050
So that's what we did. He
made a video on his phone.

00:01:52.050 --> 00:01:53.620
I made a video on my phone.

00:01:53.620 --> 00:01:56.019
Later that night I dropped
the video on TikTok

00:01:56.019 --> 00:01:58.630
and I woke up early the next morning

00:01:58.630 --> 00:02:01.000
and it was already at 2 million views.

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:04.987
And I feel like it blew so
fast. Like all the positivity.

00:02:04.987 --> 00:02:07.590
- I literally, I could
watch it over and over.

00:02:07.590 --> 00:02:08.745
It's amazing.

00:02:08.745 --> 00:02:10.260
So Kitrel and Amir,

00:02:10.260 --> 00:02:13.230
this has led to like a true
friendship as well, right?

00:02:13.230 --> 00:02:14.974
- Yes. Yes ma'am. It definitely did.

00:02:14.974 --> 00:02:16.580
My dad always told me, like,

00:02:16.580 --> 00:02:18.620
I always knew how to pick
my friends and you know,

00:02:18.620 --> 00:02:20.785
you can always tell
genuine people. You know?

00:02:20.785 --> 00:02:21.618
- Yeah.

00:02:21.618 --> 00:02:23.340
- [Kitrel] And it's just so crazy

00:02:23.340 --> 00:02:24.300
how the whole thing went down.

00:02:24.300 --> 00:02:25.290
But like, in our city,

00:02:25.290 --> 00:02:27.060
like a lot of people
don't support each other.

00:02:27.060 --> 00:02:29.130
So for us to get together
and support and you know,

00:02:29.130 --> 00:02:30.753
love each other how we do, like family.

00:02:30.753 --> 00:02:31.586
- Yeah.

00:02:31.586 --> 00:02:32.590
- [Kitrel] I'm just, I just can't wait

00:02:32.590 --> 00:02:34.160
to see what we have in
store for the future.

00:02:34.160 --> 00:02:35.289
- [Kelly] I love that!

00:02:35.289 --> 00:02:38.900
(cheering and clapping)

00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:41.250
- [Amir] I met them and it's just crazy

00:02:41.250 --> 00:02:44.890
how we all went together, did a video

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:47.820
and put smiles on people's
faces. Our vibe was there

00:02:47.820 --> 00:02:49.897
and I'm excited for the future

00:02:49.897 --> 00:02:51.760
and what's the outcome from it.

00:02:51.760 --> 00:02:54.568
- Oh my God. You are bringing so much joy.

00:02:54.568 --> 00:02:56.119
And by the way, thank you guys.

00:02:56.119 --> 00:02:58.239
Thank you PJ, Kitrel, and Amir!

00:02:58.239 --> 00:03:00.822
I'm liking your post right now.

00:03:02.034 --> 00:03:03.770
And that's not all y'all.

00:03:03.770 --> 00:03:05.620
Our season long partner, Pilot Pen,

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:08.290
makers of G2, the go to pen
of the Kelly Clarkson show.

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:10.330
They want to honor ultimate overachievers,

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:12.366
just like you, people that
make us laugh and smile.

00:03:12.366 --> 00:03:14.160
So they're going to be writing you a check

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:16.390
for a thousand dollars to
split amongst the three of you!

00:03:16.390 --> 00:03:18.787
(cheering)

00:03:18.787 --> 00:03:20.470
- Thank you, thank you,
thank you, thank you.

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:22.320
- All right y'all! Thank you so much!

